

⭐ Playback Bar — Full Specification

This is not a normal video scrubber.This is a temporal control surface for a simulation engine.

It has six functional zones, each with a clear purpose and API‑level behavior.

1. Core Transport Controls

These are the basic playback actions, but tuned for simulation precision.

Play / Pause

Emits onPlay() and onPause() events

Syncs with the SyncController

Stop

Resets to frame 0

Clears overlays until playback resumes

Frame Step (Forward/Back)

Steps by exact frame index, not time delta

Critical for analyzing Θ, Ξ, organisms

Jump to Start / End

Useful for comparing initial vs final field states

