⭐ How the Playback Bar interacts with the engine

When the user scrubs:

MediaEngine seeks

SyncController requests data for that time

OverlayEngine renders layers

BlueprintPanel updates metadata

When playback runs:

SyncController drives the entire loop

Overlays update every frame

Regime markers animate if dynamic

When looping:

A/B markers override natural playback

SyncController resets to A on reaching B



